---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | RentWheels"
  description="Terms of service and booking enquiry conditions for RentWheels Mumbai."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="container legal-page-container">
    <div class="draft-notice caption-2">
      Draft pending owner legal review. Figures and policies subject to final execution.
    </div>

    <h1 class="heading-2 page-title">Terms of Service</h1>

    <div class="legal-content body-3">
      <h2>1. Purpose of the Website</h2>
      <p>
        RentWheels is a discovery and booking enquiry portal for vehicle rentals in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Sending an enquiry through this site does not constitute a legally binding reservation, guaranteed vehicle availability, or financial charge.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Rental Periods and Indicative Pricing</h2>
      <p>
        Rates displayed are estimates calculated per 24-hour cycle. Final rental rates, applicable taxes (GST), security deposits, and insurance parameters are finalized directly with the operator upon enquiry confirmation.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Driver Eligibility & Documentation</h2>
      <p>
        Customers must possess a valid, unexpired government-issued driving license appropriate for the vehicle class rented (e.g., transport category for buses, commercial heavy license for trucks, valid two-wheeler license for bikes/scooters). Identity verification (Aadhaar, Passport) is mandatory before vehicle handover.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Changes and Cancellations</h2>
      <p>
        Submitted enquiries can be modified or canceled prior to formal operator confirmation without penalty by contacting support with your reference code.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page-container {
    padding-top: var(--space-600);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-900);
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .draft-notice {
    background-color: rgba(209, 176, 0, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-yellow-500);
    color: var(--color-yellow-500);
    padding: var(--space-100) var(--space-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-400);
  }

  .page-title {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-600);
  }

  .legal-content {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-400);
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-100);
  }

  .legal-content p {
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
